WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
My people have done a fantastic job.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:04.600
And, yes, I called in the National Guard,

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.560
and the National Guard took care of business.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.120
And they weren't politically correct,

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.320
but they took care of business.

